   "phrasing": "greet_ans_28"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Is there a way to screenshot a whole webpage, not just what's on the screen?",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 0.32,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg10"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Yes, most phones can do a scrolling screenshot. Take a normal screenshot, then look for a button that says scroll or full page in the preview.",
   "est_sec": 8.16,
   "gap_before": 0.94,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg10"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Oh, I see it. Full page. It saved it as a PDF though.",
   "est_sec": 4.13,
   "gap_before": 0.74,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg10"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That happens in some browsers. A PDF is actually handy for long recipes or tickets, it keeps everything readable.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 0.52,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg10"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "It's a train booking, so fine. Can I",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 1.05,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg10"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "can I find it offline later?",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 2.38,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg10"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "It's saved to your files, so yes, no signal needed. Maybe rename it so you don't hunt for it at the station.",
   "est_sec": 6.92,
   "gap_before": 1.12,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg10"
  },
  {
